  "question": "A single proof is bounded by neither side's work but by the handshake between them: at PASTA_R5_INFLIGHT=2 the producer blocked ~72 s on a full channel while the prover starved ~41 s on an empty one. Does a deeper channel buy wall clock, and where is the knee?",
